<h1>Specification of Works Acknowledgement</h1>

<p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);"><%= format_date(today, :long) %></p>

<p>
  This Specification of Works document forms part of the contract made between the Owner and Builder.
</p>

<p>
  The Owner acknowledges receiving the Specification of Works Document, and that this document
  has been read and understood.
</p>

<h2>Authorised Works</h2>

<p>I authorise and request the following works to be carried out:</p>

<ul>
  <li>Organise a builder's site evaluation</li>
  <li>Order soil test</li>
  <li>Order footing design</li>
  <li>Order masonry articulation layout</li>
  <li>Prepare Builder file and council documentation</li>
  <li>Order Energy Efficiency</li>
  <li>Order wind classification</li>
  <li>Order structural certificate (if required)</li>
  <li>Prepare full working drawings</li>
  <li>Obtain council approval</li>
  <li>Arrange colour selection</li>
</ul>

<h2>Property Details</h2>

<p style="font-size: var(--font-size-lg); font-weight: bold; padding: var(--space-4); background: #f5f5f5; border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
  <%= @job[:full_address] %>
</p>

<h2>Additional Authorisations</h2>

<p>In relation to my property to be built in accordance with this specification, I authorize the builder/builder's representative to:</p>

<ul>
  <li>Lodge plans and collect same on my behalf</li>
  <li>Obtain Covenant Approval if Required</li>
</ul>

<div style="margin: var(--space-8) 0; padding: var(--space-4); background: #f0f9ff; border: 1px solid #bae6fd;">
  <p style="margin: 0;">
    <strong>I acknowledge that this Specification of Works has been thoroughly reviewed and
    fully understood prior to signing.</strong>
  </p>
</div>

<%= render "signature_block" %>

<div style="margin-top: var(--space-8); padding-top: var(--space-4); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
  <p style="margin: 0; font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--color-text-muted);">
    <strong><%= @job[:full_address] %></strong><br>
    <%= @company[:name] %> | QBCC Licence <%= @company[:qbcc_license] %>
  </p>
</div>
